OL,3,AStrictly returns with new hosting trio
OL,4,Aas celebrities find out dance pairings
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrictly Come Dancing has returned to
OL,7,Fthe small screen for its 24th series,
OL,8,Fin a new era for the show with a
OL,9,Frevamped presenting line-up.
OL,11,FAn average of 5.3 million viewers tuned
OL,12,Fin on Saturday with a share of 49.2% of
OL,13,Fthe overnight ratings, which was 7% up
OL,14,Fon last year, and it remained high on
OL,15,FiPlayer's most popular chart on Sunday.
OL,17,FBroadcaster Emma Willis, comedian Josh
OL,18,FWiddicombe and former Strictly
OL,19,Fprofessional Johannes Radebe made their
OL,20,Fpresenting debut, taking over from Tess
OL,21,FDaly and Claudia Winkleman, who left
OL,22,Flast year.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
